<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-Prime Utilities year loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Prime Utilities year loss.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended April 30</p>
<p>		     (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss		    243.71	  vs loss  2.69</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents) loss  406.0	   vs loss  6.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss		241.20	  vs loss  1.54</p>
<p>    Turnover		    226.19	  vs     146.28</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)	  1.0	   vs	 1.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Loss per share calculated on 60 million shares vs 45 million shares a year ago. Prime Utilities Bhd's year loss mainly due to write off of 256 million ringgit billed revenue by sewerage unit Indah Water Konsortium Sdn Bhd.</p>
</text>
